# Each app has its own settings template:
#   apps/web/.env.example   -> the web app (Supabase URL + public anon key only)
#
# SECRET values never go in any app, file in Git, or Vercel:
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY          -> Supabase Edge Function secrets (Phase 6)
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY  -> stays inside the Supabase dashboard
#   Database password          -> your password manager
